@startuml file-header
' ============================================================================
' file-header.puml — the 64-byte PersistentARTrie FileHeader at block 0.
' Source of truth: src/persistent_artrie/core/disk_manager.rs (struct FileHeader,
' #[repr(C, align(64))]). Drawn as a CONTIGUOUS colored byte table (offset column +
' field column, one row per field) hosted in a floating note — a struct/RFC-style
' byte map whose rows share borders (no gaps), not a staggered box stack. Full-cell
' color via Creole |<#hex>| cells (same engine as the swatch legend).
' Color key (house palette + persistence accents — docs/diagrams/README.md):
'   green  #C8E6C9  identity (magic, version)
'   amber  #FFE0B2  flags / counters
'   teal   #B2DFDB  swizzled overlay root pointer
'   blue   #BBDEFB  allocator state (free-list head)
'   grey   #ECEFF1  alignment padding
'   purple #E1BEE7  integrity (64-bit content-hash checksum; FNV-1a in code)
'   indigo #C5CAE9  checkpoint image-coverage frontier (#48, v2+)
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam TitleFontSize 15
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #37474F
}

title FileHeader — the 64-byte descriptor at block 0

note as FH
|= bytes |= field |
|<#C8E6C9> 0..7 |<#C8E6C9> magic = 0x5041525400010000  ('PART' v1.0) |
|<#C8E6C9> 8..11 |<#C8E6C9> version = 2 |
|<#FFE0B2> 12..15 |<#FFE0B2> flags  (reserved) |
|<#B2DFDB> 16..23 |<#B2DFDB> root_ptr  — swizzled overlay root |
|<#FFE0B2> 24..27 |<#FFE0B2> block_count |
|<#ECEFF1> 28..31 |<#ECEFF1> _pad1  (alignment) |
|<#BBDEFB> 32..39 |<#BBDEFB> free_list_head  (0 = none) |
|<#FFE0B2> 40..47 |<#FFE0B2> entry_count |
|<#E1BEE7> 48..55 |<#E1BEE7> checksum  — 64-bit content hash of header |
|<#C5CAE9> 56..63 |<#C5CAE9> image_checkpoint_lsn  — #48 frontier (v2+) |
end note

legend bottom
| Color | Field |
|<#C8E6C9>| identity — magic · version |
|<#FFE0B2>| flags / counters |
|<#B2DFDB>| swizzled overlay-root pointer |
|<#BBDEFB>| allocator — free-list head |
|<#ECEFF1>| alignment padding |
|<#E1BEE7>| 64-bit integrity checksum |
|<#C5CAE9>| checkpoint image-coverage frontier (v2+) |
endlegend
@enduml
